From e59a79d14857366046960cca9a67887385ea2b86 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 21:28:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Refuse worker pool repins without an eligible
 machine

Resolve the full coordination-label target against the live registry before Board CAS; retain policy and events on no_machine, and report eligible machines. Remove unused queue_decision origin_intent.

Proof: regression red on base (8 failures); focused consumers 222 passed; removed no_machine guard killed by 3 queued-status tests; CLI eligible output covered; scripts/check all 18 checks green.
---
 hermes_cli/kanban_worker_placement.py         |  7 +--
